# members.csv — squadron member roster for role assignments.
# Copy to members.csv (gitignored — contains participant e-mail addresses).
#
# Format: team,identity[,type]   (one member per line; `#` = comment;
# header optional; inline comments are stripped)
#   team     — squadron number, 1-99 (leading zero optional: 8 and 08 both work)
#   identity — Entra e-mail (UPN) OR a raw object ID (GUID). E-mail resolution
#              needs directory-read rights on the tenant; without them, have
#              each member run `az ad signed-in-user show --query id -o tsv`
#              and paste the GUID.
#   type     — optional; User | Group | ServicePrincipal (default User).
#              Non-User principals must be given as raw object IDs.
#
# team,identity,type
1,alex.squadron01@example.com
1,blair.squadron01@example.com
2,charlie.squadron02@example.com
# Raw object IDs also work — and are required for groups/service principals:
2,9f6c1d2e-aaaa-bbbb-cccc-1234567890ab,Group
